From 7769b8d10256c72b11fd940c3a03c51c0eda0a5f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rime-fork <rime-fork@localhost>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 15:59:20 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Add Penglai settings window
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

A settings window inside the input method (menu item 蓬萊設定…) that reads
the deployed config through librime and writes changes back to the line
where each value lives in the user's *.custom.yaml, leaving every other
line untouched. Lists every config key the code reads (from a catalog
generated from source), shows where each value comes from, flags keys
nothing reads, toggles list-based features, and keeps an undo history.

`Squirrel --settings --user-dir DIR` opens the same window on a sandbox
copy for testing and screenshots.
